# {{ .Name }} (Resource)

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

## About

Each `{{ .Name }}` adds one user or one SSO group to one team. Use `for_each` over a set of email addresses to manage many members; adding or removing an email then changes only that member. Members that Terraform does not manage are not changed.

A user is identified by email address and an SSO group by its name as your identity provider reports it. The provider does not create users: they sign in through your identity provider.

This resource is backed by SELECT's v2 API, at `/v2/teams/{team_id}/members`.

